# {{ name }}

A child theme of `{{ parent }}`. Verso looks for every view here first, then in `{{ parent }}`, then in the default theme.

- Copy a view from the parent into `views/` to change it, like `views/parts/header.blade.php`.
- Add page templates to `templates` in `theme.json` and their views to `views/templates/`.
- Add block patterns as JSON files in `patterns/`.
- `assets/theme.css` loads after the CSS of the parent theme.

See docs/THEMES.md in Verso for the template hierarchy.
